OL,3,GNEWSATwo women on dog rescue die in
OL,4,Acrash in Romania
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo British women on a dog rescue trip
OL,7,Fhave been killed in a crash in Romania.
OL,9,FRachael Harvey-Purkiss, from Essex, and
OL,10,Fa woman from Northamptonshire were in a
OL,11,Fcollision which, according to reports,
OL,12,Finvolved multiple vehicles near the
OL,13,FSerbian border on Thursday.
OL,15,FThe women were in the country having
OL,16,Fcollected dogs on behalf of UK-based
OL,17,FHomeward Bound, which helps street dogs
OL,18,Fin Turkey. It is understood a number of
OL,19,Fdogs also died in the crash.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
