OL,3,GNEWSATwo women on dog rescue die in
OL,4,Acrash in Romania
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a Facebook post, Homeward Bound said
OL,7,Fit was devastated and described the
OL,8,Fwomen as "two beautiful rare diamonds".
